#. Translators: Label of the edit field to enter key (password) to secure the remote connection.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\dialogs.py:137
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\dialogs.py:537
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\dialogs.py:800
msgid "&Key:"
